          "thread": "Regulatory and institutional legitimacy",
          "why": "CFTC-regulated INJ futures on Bitnomial, a dedicated DC policy institute, and the Microsoft Nova Program formed a coordinated legitimacy campaign that readers tracked as a single institutional-acceptance bet."
